# CometGUI -- jpackage options for Windows x64 (Phase 14, unit 5).
#
# NEVER EXECUTED.  Written on a Linux host: jpackage is not a cross-compiler
# (the Linux JDK's jdk.jpackage module contains no Windows bundler), and no
# Windows machine exists in this environment.  Nothing here has been shown to
# work; Phase 16's Windows runner is the first place it can run.
#
# What is known without running it (docs/feasibility/toolchain.rst, "The
# Windows runner"):
#   * msi and exe need the WiX Toolset on PATH (v3 candle/light, or v4/v5
#     wix.exe).  An app-image (--type app-image) needs only the JDK and is the
#     low-risk fallback.
#   * An msi version is major.minor.build with major and minor at most 255 and
#     build at most 65535; 0.1.0 satisfies that.
#   * Comet's Thermo RAW companions (CometWrapper.dll, ThermoFisher.*) are
#     installed by the product beside the Comet executable at run time, never
#     baked into this installer.
#
# --win-upgrade-uuid identifies the product to Windows Installer across
# versions, so an install of a newer CometGUI replaces an older one.  It was
# generated once on 2026-10-23 and MUST NEVER CHANGE after a release ships.
#
# No --icon: the project has no .ico yet.

--type msi
--win-upgrade-uuid 40e2cf2f-aea1-4ba4-9c12-b0311d26046a
--win-dir-chooser
--win-menu
--win-menu-group CometGUI
--win-shortcut
